        "action_date": "2025-03-10",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>DMEPOS Relief Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill extends until December 31, 2025, a higher payment rate (known as the 75/25 blended rate) for durable medical equipment in nonrural or noncontiguous areas under Medicare.</p>",
